//! Closure-based thread spawning.
// Safe, closure-based thread spawning, built on `libc::thread`'s raw
// pthread wrapper. Depends on `libc` and on `std` directly: a package
// sees only its own dependencies' names, not theirs, so `libc`'s
// dependency on `std` does not make `std::` paths visible here.
// Executables link with lib/libc/thread.c and `-lpthread`, as every build does.
use package::thread;
export thread;
